{"v":4,"catch":"使用球體消滅敵人！ ！\n佔領大量城堡並拯救公主Electra！","desc":"《Exvania》是NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment）於1992年發行的動作遊戲。\n目標是引爆球體，擊敗其他對手，並拯救陷入最後階段的公主Electra。\n打破寶箱並拿走其中的物品來增強自己，讓自己比對手更有優勢。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2024-04-04","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–4 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":4,"poff":4,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8552bd5fe20f94b3caa034e8c1a50515732d51dd7162cc0c045c453f88622a4a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/13f7a3e2881fdc0e92ab5c7cee69bdbd3fd63800d636c3e752a91391d8da31b0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/46dfe9c449bafea1253cd4e9be566f1668fced36fb039f8295c7773540912950.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6c2e25db77c30a5825215cd4cae2de0693e138eb644affaf295bbad64044bf1a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4dfda2a7f3b6681dadb270d738245003742fe90ba0bd169e71633b75f2e6089f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/46e166ac15559fb40f202b305bf47b1bb31ebc22c4fbe0f88022d75349ea729b.jpg"],"titleId":"0100a5801de06000","dlc":[]}